<title>USA: Diana not commenting on stock decline.</title>
<headline>Diana not commenting on stock decline.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diana Corp, in a statement on Friday, repeated its policy of not commenting on the activity in its stock.</p>
<p>Diana was trading midday at 36-5/8, off 2-5/8, on 200,200 shares.</p>
<p>The company provides telecommunications equipment for use in public switched telephone networks and for private data networks.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
